// The flow the host tests run. Two stories, so the serial describe and the
// shared scope are both exercised: the second reads what the first captured.

story: Sign in
outputs: heading: string
  Open "/"
  Click the sign in button
  Type "connected2atul@gmail.com" into the username field
  Type "qwerty123" into the password field
  Click the login button
  Remember the text of the dashboard heading as heading
  The dashboard heading should be visible

story (idempotent): Check the heading
  The dashboard heading should contain {Sign in.heading}

compose: sign in and check
  Sign in
  Check the heading

test: sign in and check
